<title>JAPAN: Miyakoshi up on China firm share plan.</title>
<headline>Miyakoshi up on China firm share plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Miyakoshi Corp rose on Wednesday morning after its largest shareholder, a Chinese firm, announced plans to buy an extra six million shares in the electrical equipment maker.</p>
<p>By 0034 GMT, the shares had climbed 10 yen to 400.</p>
</text>
